{:id "0055-lab-default-feel"
 :title "Lab default feel: Plain keeps a little flourish, dress and readings stop changing behind your back, and gold glows gold"
 :lupa/deps #{"0057-lab-webgpu-guard"}
 :lupa/area :lab
 :lupa/risk :medium
 :goal "Three things the builders of 0050 and 0052 reported, all from the
        foreman's design, which together make the default experience show
        too little (open-questions Q30, Q31). (1) Auto is the default
        style and falls back to Plain when the typing rhythm lapses; Plain
        has no flourish, so it performs no marks and wears no dress, and a
        visitor who types at an ordinary pace sees almost nothing of the
        score, while dress put on in another style vanishes about six
        seconds after typing stops. (2) A read-back planned in one style
        is played in whatever style Auto drifts to, so its gestures can
        outlast what they were granted. (3) The glow's halo is always
        vermilion, so gilt letters glint pink. Ben's instruction was to
        make the best aesthetic choice and keep going: Plain means plain
        motion with restrained flourish; bareness is the reveal level's
        job (level 0)."
 :scope ["src/halfahead/lab/style.cljc" "test/halfahead/lab/style_test.cljc"
         "test/halfahead/lab/marks_test.cljc"
         "src/halfahead/lab/reading.cljc" "test/halfahead/lab/reading_test.cljc"
         "src/halfahead/lab/dress.cljc" "test/halfahead/lab/dress_test.cljc"
         "src/halfahead/lab/main.cljs" "src/halfahead/lab/render.cljs"
         "e2e/lab.mjs" "docs/LAB.md"]
 :design "1. Plain's point. (style/point :plain) becomes {:energy 0.5
          :flourish 0.35 :softness 0.5 :warmth 0.5}. Its motion parameters
          do not change: (params :plain) is as before, and (from-point
          (point :plain)) still equals it. With flourish 0.35 Plain
          performs marks of amount 0.62 or more (a held word, a landing,
          capitals) and dresses asides (whisper), the strongest stress
          (gilt, its warmth being 0.5) and other strong stresses (strong),
          but never a versal. Update the tests that pin Plain's point or
          say Plain performs or wears nothing (style, marks, reading,
          dress), keeping every property.
          2. Dress that stays. The draft's dress is decided by the style
          point in force when the text last changed (an edit), not
          re-derived from the style in force on each frame: lab.main
          keeps that point with the draft's dress and recomputes dress
          only on an edit or when the writer picks a style (the picker,
          its shortcuts). So in Auto, dress no longer changes or vanishes
          while the writer is idle. With the picker on Auto, the point
          used at an edit is that of the style Auto infers at that
          moment.
          3. A reading keeps its style. When a read-back starts, lab.main
          notes the named style in force then (for Auto, the style it
          infers at that moment), plans the reading with that style's
          point and motion parameters, and while the reading plays gives
          frame that style as :style-choice, whatever Auto would infer
          meanwhile; when the reading is over, or is ended by Escape or
          an edit, the picker's choice applies again. (The writer is not
          typing during a reading: an edit ends it.) lab.pose and the
          schema do not change.
          4. Gold glows gold. In lab.render the glow halo's colour is the
          letter's own ink when the letter has an ink other than :text
          (mixed by its :tint), and vermilion as before otherwise. No new
          attribute if the existing ink attributes can be used; no new
          draw call.
          Tests: (point :plain) and from-point at it; gesture-for and
          dress-for at Plain's point for the acceptance sentence of 0044
          (which marks perform: the hold and the landing; which dress:
          the aside's whisper); a reading planned in Elegant keeps
          Elegant's parameters for its cues at every later time (pure, in
          reading_test, by the data lab.main will pass).
          e2e/lab.mjs: (a) dress step: with the picker on Auto and
          ?reveal=1, type 'This is *the one thing* that matters (trust
          me).' at a slow, steady pace (so Auto reads Elegant), then wait
          8 s without typing: the dress in lastFrame is the same as 1 s
          after typing stopped (same glyph ids, inks and sizes); replace
          'Plain wears nothing' by: Plain gives gilt and whisper for that
          sentence and no versal for a 14-word one; at ?reveal=0 nothing
          is dressed in any style. (b) reading step: in Plain at 250 wpm
          the reading of the acceptance sentence performs swell on
          'loooove' and nod on 'Ship it' (window.__lab.reading()
          .performing). (c) glint: with the pointer over the gilt phrase,
          sample the screenshot's halo pixels just outside a gold
          letter's ink: their hue is nearer to the palette's gold than to
          vermilion (compare distances in rgb); screenshot
          out/lab/dress-glint.png. Every other step passes unchanged, or
          say exactly which assertion changed and why.
          docs/LAB.md: Plain's flourish, dress staying, a reading's
          style, the halo's colour."
 :acceptance
 ["Tests as in the design, on both hosts; `bb test` stays green"
  "`bb lab:e2e` passes with the changed steps and every other step; the
   final message lists every existing assertion that had to change"
  "out/lab/dress-glint.png for the foreman, the gold's halo gold"]
 :non-goals
 ["No change to the other named styles' points or to any style's motion
   parameters; no change to marks' rules, gestures, synth, pace, score,
   the director, reveal or the stage; do not edit the schema"
  "Do not run `bb e2e` or `bb play`"]
 :context ["docs/product/open-questions.md" "docs/product/score.md"
           "src/halfahead/lab/style.cljc" "src/halfahead/lab/marks.cljc"
           "src/halfahead/lab/reading.cljc" "src/halfahead/lab/dress.cljc"
           "src/halfahead/lab/pose.cljc" "src/halfahead/lab/main.cljs"
           "src/halfahead/lab/render.cljs" "src/halfahead/lab/ink.cljc"
           "e2e/lab.mjs" "docs/LAB.md" "DESIGN.md"]
 :budget-usd 12.0}
